WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:25.650
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:25.920 --> 00:27.050
When we were little,

3
00:27.550 --> 00:29.210
you always scrimped and saved

4
00:29.870 --> 00:31.140
to buy me food.

5
00:33.450 --> 00:34.600
Eat more.

6
00:42.320 --> 00:43.150
Sixth Master,

7
00:44.070 --> 00:45.430
what do we do now?

8
00:46.400 --> 00:48.490
Zhang Dancheng told me this

9
00:49.720 --> 00:51.320
because he wants to use me

10
00:51.780 --> 00:52.970
to kill Sect Master.

11
00:53.140 --> 00:55.210
Why don't I just kill them all?

12
00:55.320 --> 00:56.250
Keep them alive.

13
00:56.810 --> 00:58.210
After I kill Sect Master,

14
00:58.540 --> 01:00.140
I'm going to make them

15
01:01.010 --> 01:02.010
take the fall.

16
01:04.340 --> 01:05.170
Scared?

17
01:06.700 --> 01:07.580
Sixth Master,

18
01:08.010 --> 01:10.860
you picked me out of a pile of corpses.

19
01:10.940 --> 01:12.340
My life is yours.

20
01:12.560 --> 01:14.090
Whoever you want to kill...

21
01:15.620 --> 01:17.880
I, Fan Yifei, will be the first to strike.

22
01:18.730 --> 01:19.530
Let's go.

23
01:21.060 --> 01:22.990
Bring Shangguan Chengming along.

24
03:09.370 --> 03:13.120
[A Prophet]

25
03:13.880 --> 03:16.260
[Episode 23]

26
03:23.620 --> 03:25.150
Bringing you two back means

27
03:25.340 --> 03:27.340
I've completed Sect Master's task.

28
03:27.780 --> 03:28.640
After tonight,

29
03:28.970 --> 03:30.410
the act you and your mentor put on

30
03:30.410 --> 03:31.650
can come to an end.

31
03:32.050 --> 03:33.450
After I kill Sect Master,

32
03:34.180 --> 03:35.410
I'll let you go.

33
03:36.250 --> 03:37.460
I may be a scoundrel,

34
03:38.570 --> 03:40.130
but I keep my word.

35
03:38.920 --> 03:41.110
[Equally Adept at the Pen and the Sword]

36
03:59.300 --> 04:00.130
What is it?

37
04:08.250 --> 04:09.310
I know everything.

38
04:10.680 --> 04:11.560
Know what?

39
04:13.380 --> 04:14.580
You killed my mother.

40
04:19.810 --> 04:20.540
Yes.

41
04:23.200 --> 04:25.400
You've been lying to me all these years.

42
04:26.810 --> 04:27.450
Yes.

43
04:29.210 --> 04:30.100
Why?

44
04:32.370 --> 04:33.330
I felt like it.

45
04:35.010 --> 04:35.810
Then today,

46
04:37.010 --> 04:38.500
let's settle this score.

47
04:40.130 --> 04:41.190
How do we settle it?

48
04:46.300 --> 04:47.180
With your life.

49
04:48.230 --> 04:48.790
Wait!

50
04:50.659 --> 04:51.720
Since it's the end,

51
04:52.420 --> 04:54.820
you should at least let me say my last words.

52
04:56.740 --> 04:57.450
Go on.

53
04:58.360 --> 04:59.970
I only have one request.

54
05:04.690 --> 05:07.010
I want to hear you call me

55
05:07.010 --> 05:07.860
Dad.

56
05:09.510 --> 05:11.120
Then I can die in peace.

57
05:16.040 --> 05:17.120
Call me Dad.

58
05:19.180 --> 05:19.860
Go on.

59
05:23.140 --> 05:24.550
Say it.

60
05:26.450 --> 05:27.420
What's wrong?

61
05:28.980 --> 05:30.100
Can't say it?

62
05:31.020 --> 05:32.880
Or do you think I don't deserve it?

63
05:37.940 --> 05:39.620
No way.

64
05:40.060 --> 05:41.940
Is it that hard?

65
05:53.270 --> 05:55.310
I raised you since you were little.

66
05:56.100 --> 05:58.630
I sent you to a private school to learn to read,

67
05:58.690 --> 06:00.660
hired Flying Dagger Li from Shanxi

68
06:00.660 --> 06:02.450
to teach you martial arts,

69
06:03.370 --> 06:05.130
and let you live a decent life.

70
06:05.150 --> 06:08.500
I remember that when you first joined the sect, you were about 10.

71
06:08.500 --> 06:10.030
Those Batous bullied you,

72
06:10.050 --> 06:12.230
stole all the food in your bowl, leaving you with

73
06:12.230 --> 06:13.750
only steamed cornbread to eat.

74
06:13.750 --> 06:15.570
You hid behind this house and cried.

75
06:15.570 --> 06:16.700
When I witnessed it,

76
06:17.100 --> 06:17.940
without hesitation,

77
06:17.940 --> 06:19.060
I gave them 10 lashes each.

78
06:19.060 --> 06:21.540
From then on, you had meat, endless meat,

79
06:21.540 --> 06:23.180
every day.

80
06:23.660 --> 06:25.450
I made that happen.

81
06:25.940 --> 06:26.890
For this alone,

82
06:26.910 --> 06:29.960
shouldn't you call me Dad?

83
06:30.680 --> 06:31.600
There's more.

84
06:31.620 --> 06:32.820
When you were 15,

85
06:32.890 --> 06:34.450
you had a huge boil on your butt,

86
06:34.450 --> 06:35.770
as big as an egg.

87
06:35.770 --> 06:37.500
No doctor could cure it.

88
06:37.520 --> 06:38.570
I had no choice

89
06:38.600 --> 06:40.520
but to cut it open with a knife,

90
06:40.890 --> 06:42.690
put my mouth on your butt cheek,

91
06:43.100 --> 06:44.659
and suck the pus out.

92
06:44.690 --> 06:46.330
I sucked it for 7 days,

93
06:46.690 --> 06:47.950
before you got better.

94
06:48.250 --> 06:49.909
You told me not to tell anyone.

95
06:50.060 --> 06:51.120
I knew you were embarrassed,

96
06:51.120 --> 06:53.120
so I didn't breathe a word to anyone.

97
06:53.740 --> 06:54.620
You even said,

98
06:55.330 --> 06:56.010
"Master,

99
06:57.420 --> 07:00.660
you treat me better than my own mother."

100
07:01.810 --> 07:03.610
Even with this,

101
07:04.370 --> 07:07.570
you still can't call me Dad?

102
07:11.180 --> 07:11.740
Say it.

103
07:15.890 --> 07:16.690
Say it.

104
07:20.330 --> 07:20.860
Dad.

105
07:21.330 --> 07:23.540
Louder.

106
07:25.420 --> 07:26.210
Dad!

107
07:26.210 --> 07:27.010
Good!

108
07:28.300 --> 07:30.250
You can still call me Dad!

109
07:30.420 --> 07:31.890
Thank you!

110
07:31.890 --> 07:33.370
You still want to kill me!

111
07:33.370 --> 07:35.130
Thank you!

112
07:35.130 --> 07:37.130
You ingrate!

113
07:37.130 --> 07:39.770
You'd have starved to death without me!

114
07:39.860 --> 07:40.890
Even if you lived,

115
07:40.980 --> 07:43.940
you'd just be some lousy fisherman in a seaside village.

116
07:43.940 --> 07:45.300
I killed your mother

117
07:45.300 --> 07:47.100
to cut off your attachments,

118
07:47.100 --> 07:50.300
so you could start anew!

119
07:50.300 --> 07:52.100
And you still want to kill me?

120
07:55.860 --> 07:56.740
Dad...

121
07:58.940 --> 07:59.810
Go.

122
08:00.570 --> 08:02.860
Get my shoe back.

123
08:37.330 --> 08:38.419
Come.

124
08:38.730 --> 08:40.179
Put it on for me.

125
08:49.480 --> 08:51.170
Why couldn't you just

126
08:52.570 --> 08:54.090
make it easy on yourself?

127
09:08.970 --> 09:10.780
Now it's my turn to ask you.

128
09:11.660 --> 09:13.970
Any last words?

129
09:15.260 --> 09:16.060
Mother,

130
09:18.180 --> 09:19.810
why do I feel...

131
09:20.660 --> 09:21.610
so wronged

132
09:21.900 --> 09:24.420
inside?

133
09:31.420 --> 09:32.730
I taught you:

134
09:33.660 --> 09:34.730
to kill,

135
09:36.260 --> 09:37.390
you must be ruthless

136
09:38.780 --> 09:39.810
and swift.

137
09:41.330 --> 09:43.060
You just think too much.

138
09:52.300 --> 09:54.210
Did you really think I wouldn't know

139
09:54.210 --> 09:55.670
what you've been plotting

140
09:56.060 --> 09:57.140
behind my back?

141
09:58.060 --> 10:00.850
Heavy is my mantle of leadership.

142
10:01.690 --> 10:02.810
There's no hurry.

143
10:03.380 --> 10:05.710
I'll personally escort you onto the stage

144
10:06.420 --> 10:08.450
and let you put on a one-man show.

145
10:09.380 --> 10:10.570
Take him away.

146
10:12.660 --> 10:13.810
You, stay.

147
10:19.490 --> 10:20.570
See that?

148
10:24.300 --> 10:25.160
Are you scared?

149
10:25.940 --> 10:26.660
I am.

150
10:29.610 --> 10:30.940
From now on,

151
10:31.580 --> 10:32.940
you are him:

152
10:34.450 --> 10:35.940
the Sixth Batou.

153
10:40.090 --> 10:41.210
Thank you, Master.

154
10:43.140 --> 10:45.940
Notify the Batous to gather in the ancestral hall.

155
11:06.970 --> 11:08.330
Sixth Batou is dead.

156
11:13.570 --> 11:14.850
He died because of you.

157
11:16.800 --> 11:18.090
Back then, you bribed Lu Qinhai

158
11:18.090 --> 11:20.020
to kill Master Swindler's mother.

159
11:20.300 --> 11:21.850
You kept it from him for so many years.

160
11:21.850 --> 11:23.490
When Master Swindler learned of the truth,

161
11:23.490 --> 11:24.780
you silenced him.

162
11:26.380 --> 11:28.380
This is your venerable sect master.

163
11:28.660 --> 11:30.090
Shut up!

164
11:30.970 --> 11:33.660
It was Sect Master who saved Master Swindler

165
11:33.660 --> 11:35.490
and buried his mother back then.

166
11:35.970 --> 11:36.940
Brothers,

167
11:37.260 --> 11:39.660
it goes without saying how well

168
11:39.660 --> 11:41.260
Sect Leader has treated you.

169
11:41.450 --> 11:43.420
I believe you all know it in your hearts.

170
11:43.420 --> 11:45.020
Don't let this rogue's nonsense

171
11:45.020 --> 11:46.820
cause friction within the sect!

172
11:47.540 --> 11:48.490
Baichuan,

173
11:48.490 --> 11:50.020
calm down.

174
11:50.140 --> 11:51.540
Sit.

175
11:51.540 --> 11:52.180
I've survived

176
11:52.180 --> 11:55.090
so many years amid rumors. People have said

177
11:55.090 --> 11:56.660
all kinds of things about me.

178
11:56.660 --> 11:58.020
When we were young,

179
11:58.210 --> 12:01.020
some even said I killed the old sect master.

180
12:01.040 --> 12:02.610
Those who say these things

181
12:02.640 --> 12:05.240
simply want to revolt against Tianxiang Sect.

182
12:06.450 --> 12:07.970
What's more terrifying is

183
12:08.350 --> 12:10.550
that there are our own people involved.

184
12:10.940 --> 12:12.330
I know very well that

185
12:13.330 --> 12:15.140
it's more than just one or two.

186
12:15.540 --> 12:17.020
But don't worry.

187
12:17.450 --> 12:19.300
As long as I sit on this throne,

188
12:19.300 --> 12:22.400
I won't let the century-old foundation of Tianxiang Sect

189
12:22.400 --> 12:23.570
go up in flames.

190
12:39.730 --> 12:39.970
Master.

191
12:39.970 --> 12:40.380
Senior!

192
12:40.380 --> 12:40.900
Master!

193
12:41.380 --> 12:41.850
What's wrong?

194
12:41.850 --> 12:42.900
Master, what's wrong?

195
12:42.900 --> 12:43.610
Master.

196
12:44.170 --> 12:45.300
The tea is poisoned.

197
12:46.170 --> 12:48.850
Lock Shangguan Chengming up!

198
12:48.880 --> 12:49.720
Yes!

199
12:51.920 --> 12:52.730
Master.

200
12:53.200 --> 12:54.550
Senior, are you okay?

201
13:01.020 --> 13:02.420
Are you alright, Master?

202
13:03.820 --> 13:06.130
Quick, go brew some alum soup

203
13:06.570 --> 13:07.540
to detoxify me.

204
13:09.060 --> 13:10.580
No one follow me.

205
13:11.140 --> 13:13.730
Let me meditate and channel my qi alone

206
13:14.250 --> 13:16.130
to try to purge the poison.

207
13:17.610 --> 13:18.610
Careful, Master.

208
13:19.150 --> 13:20.240
I'll go right away.

209
13:35.940 --> 13:36.940
Old man.

210
13:37.970 --> 13:40.370
You still have to rely on me when it matters.

211
13:41.180 --> 13:42.440
I know this place well.

212
13:44.810 --> 13:47.380
How did you escape from Fan Yifei?

213
13:48.540 --> 13:50.260
Those small fry under him

214
13:50.420 --> 13:52.680
can't trap me, the Tongbei Spinning Top.

215
13:52.680 --> 13:54.040
And Chengming warned me

216
13:54.070 --> 13:55.070
to drink less.

217
13:55.570 --> 13:56.430
He doesn't know

218
13:56.540 --> 13:58.670
it takes a sea of booze to get me buzzed.

219
14:01.600 --> 14:02.480
Are you okay?

220
14:02.690 --> 14:03.420
I'm fine.

221
14:08.260 --> 14:09.390
Where's Chengming?

222
14:11.190 --> 14:12.070
Who's there?

223
14:16.690 --> 14:17.720
I'm your father!

224
14:24.550 --> 14:25.400
Stop!

225
14:27.100 --> 14:27.940
Stop!

226
14:41.660 --> 14:42.260
Mentor.

227
14:43.940 --> 14:45.880
The police tipped Sect Master off in advance.

228
14:45.880 --> 14:47.250
Fan Yifei also turned against us.

229
14:47.250 --> 14:48.730
They're trying to pin Master Swindler's death

230
14:48.730 --> 14:49.380
on me

231
14:49.380 --> 14:50.710
and accuse me of mutiny.

232
14:50.970 --> 14:51.570
Done.

233
14:51.570 --> 14:52.540
Leave the premises now.

234
14:52.540 --> 14:53.180
Okay.

235
14:55.060 --> 14:55.780
Feiyan,

236
14:56.300 --> 14:58.490
forget about your lover.

237
14:58.660 --> 15:00.660
Shangguan Chengming is absolutely

238
15:00.810 --> 15:02.180
done for this time.

239
15:02.230 --> 15:04.210
Instead of worrying about Master's health,

240
15:04.210 --> 15:05.900
you're here being sarcastic.

241
15:06.030 --> 15:07.160
Where are you going?

242
15:08.000 --> 15:09.330
To find a doctor for Sect Master.

243
15:09.330 --> 15:10.430
Should I just stand here

244
15:10.430 --> 15:11.760
doing nothing like you?

245
15:12.200 --> 15:13.200
Stop right there!

246
15:13.690 --> 15:15.110
No one can leave the premises

247
15:15.110 --> 15:16.900
until Sect Master comes out.

248
15:30.730 --> 15:31.450
Senior.

249
15:32.490 --> 15:33.690
The medicine is here.

250
15:41.970 --> 15:42.810
Senior?

251
15:44.180 --> 15:45.020
Senior?

252
15:51.090 --> 15:51.900
Senior?

253
15:52.690 --> 15:53.490
Senior!

254
15:54.020 --> 15:54.690
Senior!

255
16:13.690 --> 16:14.490
Senior!

256
16:32.140 --> 16:32.970
Senior?

257
16:36.260 --> 16:37.090
Senior.

258
16:40.940 --> 16:41.850
Somebody!

259
16:43.060 --> 16:43.970
Anybody!

260
16:44.330 --> 16:45.900
Come quickly!

261
16:46.690 --> 16:47.910
Senior.

262
16:47.930 --> 16:49.420
What's wrong with Master? Master!

263
16:49.420 --> 16:50.090
Master!

264
16:50.380 --> 16:51.490
Master!

265
16:51.690 --> 16:52.300
Master.

266
16:52.570 --> 16:53.090
This...

267
16:53.180 --> 16:53.850
Master.

268
16:59.330 --> 17:00.260
Senior.

269
17:01.800 --> 17:02.730
Second Brother.

270
17:08.099 --> 17:08.940
Senior,

271
17:10.290 --> 17:12.329
trust that I'll avenge you.

272
17:13.619 --> 17:14.619
I promise.

273
17:20.250 --> 17:21.109
Eldest Master,

274
17:21.339 --> 17:22.800
those two have been let go.

275
17:23.210 --> 17:24.619
Send this news

276
17:24.819 --> 17:26.450
to the other Batous.

277
17:27.079 --> 17:28.560
Sect Master is dead.

278
17:29.080 --> 17:31.630
The priority is to set up the funeral altar.

279
17:34.380 --> 17:35.450
Tell everyone that

280
17:36.290 --> 17:37.450
whatever it is,

281
17:38.690 --> 17:40.050
we'll talk at the funeral.

282
17:40.050 --> 17:41.180
Yes, Eldest Master.

283
17:58.190 --> 18:00.210
[Honored Ancestor and Leader, Zhou Xingsi]

284
18:05.530 --> 18:06.530
Eldest Brother,

285
18:07.660 --> 18:08.940
the time has come.

286
18:09.620 --> 18:10.480
Eldest Master,

287
18:11.380 --> 18:12.620
Feiyan isn't here.

288
18:13.010 --> 18:14.070
Let's wait for her.

289
18:14.100 --> 18:14.940
Wait for her?

290
18:15.290 --> 18:18.400
She was the closest to Shangguan Chengming.

291
18:18.730 --> 18:21.330
Sect Master is dead, yet there is no sign of her.

292
18:21.450 --> 18:23.970
Do you still not realize

293
18:24.100 --> 18:25.860
who killed Sect Master by now?

294
18:26.900 --> 18:28.760
Sect Master died an unjust death.

295
18:28.820 --> 18:31.530
Shouldn't we let him rest in peace first?

296
18:31.620 --> 18:33.420
The Chief Batou is right!

297
18:34.580 --> 18:35.940
By the order of the founder,

298
18:35.940 --> 18:39.250
the heroic soul of Zhou Xingsi,

299
18:39.340 --> 18:41.540
the 24th Sect Master of Tianxiang Sect,

300
18:41.770 --> 18:43.630
returns to a divine place of rest!

301
18:44.450 --> 18:47.140
This soul is a loyal martyr of Tianxiang,

302
18:47.210 --> 18:48.730
with towering righteousness.

303
18:48.730 --> 18:52.010
May the Lord of the Underworld show mercy

304
18:52.340 --> 18:54.140
and decree his swift reincarnation.

305
18:54.140 --> 18:57.140
Gathering from all across the land to mourn,

306
18:57.340 --> 19:00.820
we burn incense to honor our leader!

307
19:01.730 --> 19:03.590
Sect Master met such a cruel fate,

308
19:03.690 --> 19:06.350
yet Shangguan Chengming is nowhere to be found.

309
19:06.380 --> 19:09.110
What an absolute dishonor to our Tianxiang Sect.

310
19:09.580 --> 19:10.530
Today, we

311
19:10.970 --> 19:12.340
swear a blood oath to

312
19:12.970 --> 19:14.430
bring that evil scoundrel

313
19:14.970 --> 19:16.250
back to the sect!

314
19:22.620 --> 19:24.480
To the disloyal and treacherous...

315
19:24.480 --> 19:26.740
-behold this lotus! -Behold this lotus!

316
19:33.010 --> 19:35.770
I was with Sect Master the longest.

317
19:36.580 --> 19:38.580
And you're next after me, right?

318
19:40.180 --> 19:42.140
Say, were we blind

319
19:42.140 --> 19:44.210
or just completely stupid

320
19:44.210 --> 19:46.250
to ever trust Shangguan Chengming?

321
19:46.580 --> 19:49.310
He was Sect Master's blessing in his later years.

322
19:49.990 --> 19:51.270
At that age,

323
19:52.250 --> 19:54.140
who wouldn't hope for a son?

324
19:54.180 --> 19:55.260
That's true.

325
19:58.420 --> 19:59.750
I heard that some people

326
19:59.780 --> 20:03.040
in the sect have been wanting to flip the tables for a while.

327
20:04.180 --> 20:05.970
It's just a few unseasoned punks

328
20:05.970 --> 20:07.490
wagging their tongues.

329
20:09.490 --> 20:10.970
Your loyalty to Sect Master

330
20:10.970 --> 20:13.100
is obvious to all.

331
20:13.290 --> 20:14.450
I just want

332
20:14.840 --> 20:16.720
to lead a simple

333
20:16.830 --> 20:18.380
and peaceful life.

334
20:19.050 --> 20:20.100
I don't want

335
20:20.660 --> 20:21.580
anything else.

336
20:21.580 --> 20:23.140
A peaceful life is good.

337
20:23.770 --> 20:25.580
I want a peaceful life too.

338
20:26.660 --> 20:27.490
But

339
20:27.620 --> 20:29.240
Sect Master put so much effort

340
20:29.240 --> 20:31.120
into establishing this foundation,

341
20:31.120 --> 20:32.840
only to leave just like that.

342
20:33.380 --> 20:34.140
I...

343
20:34.970 --> 20:36.490
As his junior,

344
20:36.530 --> 20:38.770
shouldn't I protect the empire he built

345
20:39.420 --> 20:41.900
even if it costs me my life?

346
20:46.040 --> 20:46.900
Eldest Master,

347
20:47.940 --> 20:49.380
I'm not good with subtleties.

348
20:49.380 --> 20:50.530
Just give it

349
20:50.970 --> 20:51.970
to me straight.

350
20:51.970 --> 20:52.660
Alright.

351
20:55.660 --> 20:57.120
Fill Second Master's cup.

352
21:03.270 --> 21:04.180
Huaiyi,

353
21:04.560 --> 21:06.690
there are some things I can't spell out

354
21:06.820 --> 21:08.210
in the ancestral hall.

355
21:08.860 --> 21:10.940
I know you like Feiyan.

356
21:11.420 --> 21:14.340
But at a critical moment like this,

357
21:14.770 --> 21:15.820
I advise you

358
21:16.530 --> 21:19.090
to keep your hands clean.

359
21:37.210 --> 21:38.730
I can't believe

360
21:39.340 --> 21:41.210
Shangguan Chengming

361
21:41.210 --> 21:43.250
really killed Sect Master.

362
21:44.210 --> 21:45.620
You think it was him too?

363
21:45.730 --> 21:47.100
To prevent Sect Master

364
21:47.210 --> 21:49.900
from killing his mentor,

365
21:50.490 --> 21:52.770
that hypocrite struck first

366
21:52.900 --> 21:54.230
to kill the Sect Master,

367
21:54.580 --> 21:56.900
and then fled.

368
21:57.250 --> 21:58.530
There's no way

369
21:59.690 --> 22:01.900
Shangguan Chengming is the killer.

370
22:04.450 --> 22:05.530
It's not him?

371
22:06.970 --> 22:08.210
If not him,

372
22:08.490 --> 22:09.490
who else could it be?

373
22:09.490 --> 22:10.420
Think about it.

374
22:10.490 --> 22:12.150
The killer struck right after

375
22:12.340 --> 22:13.730
Zhang Dancheng returned.

376
22:13.730 --> 22:16.860
Isn't it obvious they're framing Shangguan Chengming?

377
22:18.210 --> 22:19.340
This person

378
22:20.620 --> 22:21.900
was too impatient.

379
22:22.580 --> 22:24.340
The mantis stalks the cicada,

380
22:25.180 --> 22:26.840
unaware of the oriole behind.

381
22:27.180 --> 22:28.490
Now,

382
22:28.490 --> 22:31.140
I see mantises and cicadas everywhere,

383
22:31.420 --> 22:34.210
but the oriole is nowhere to be found.

384
22:34.620 --> 22:37.500
Chief Batou ordered Shangguan Chengming's arrest.

385
22:37.500 --> 22:39.730
We're not getting involved in this mess,

386
22:39.730 --> 22:41.450
lest we get blindsided

387
22:41.620 --> 22:42.660
by the oriole.

388
22:43.100 --> 22:44.660
From the looks of it,

389
22:45.290 --> 22:47.970
someone is trying to revolt.

390
22:49.100 --> 22:50.050
Third Brother,

391
22:50.440 --> 22:53.570
who do you think it could be?

392
22:56.210 --> 22:58.580
Second Brother isn't ambitious.

393
22:58.730 --> 23:00.050
He just wants a peaceful end.

394
23:00.050 --> 23:01.660
He wouldn't do such a thing.

395
23:02.050 --> 23:04.140
Fourth Brother thinks he's above it all,

396
23:04.140 --> 23:05.800
so it definitely can't be him.

397
23:05.900 --> 23:06.860
Could it be...

398
23:07.970 --> 23:09.010
Eldest Brother?

399
23:10.970 --> 23:11.770
Qin Baichuan?

400
23:12.450 --> 23:14.860
He's been in Suhang for a long time,

401
23:15.010 --> 23:18.180
so there's little news of him.

402
23:18.180 --> 23:19.530
I wouldn't even know

403
23:19.820 --> 23:21.220
where to begin guessing.

404
23:22.620 --> 23:26.730
Then who do you think we should side with this time?

405
23:28.380 --> 23:29.380
Side with whom?

406
23:29.380 --> 23:31.690
At a time like this, we brothers should just

407
23:31.690 --> 23:34.350
sit on the fence and see which way the wind blows.

408
23:34.490 --> 23:36.290
Whichever way the wind blows...

409
23:36.730 --> 23:38.380
The grass bends.

410
23:40.250 --> 23:41.180
Third Brother.

411
23:42.620 --> 23:43.620
Second Master,

412
23:43.770 --> 23:46.210
I know you want a peaceful life now

413
23:46.700 --> 23:48.900
and no longer wish to live by swindling.

414
23:49.010 --> 23:50.810
But now that Sect Master is dead,

415
23:51.100 --> 23:53.940
do you think the sect will know peace?

416
23:57.340 --> 23:58.010
Someone

417
23:58.620 --> 24:00.620
set a trap for Shangguan Chengming.

418
24:00.940 --> 24:01.860
He won't

419
24:02.620 --> 24:03.880
get out of this easily.

420
24:04.380 --> 24:05.380
You came to me

421
24:06.940 --> 24:08.730
instead of going to mourn

422
24:09.290 --> 24:10.250
Sect Master.

423
24:11.580 --> 24:13.440
You want me to help him, don't you?

424
24:13.450 --> 24:14.380
Second Brother,

425
24:15.050 --> 24:16.320
in the entire sect,

426
24:17.530 --> 24:19.660
you were the most loyal to Sect Master.

427
24:19.770 --> 24:21.970
But his death is shrouded

428
24:22.140 --> 24:23.140
in mystery.

429
24:23.290 --> 24:24.530
You and I

430
24:25.250 --> 24:26.620
can't just let it go.

431
24:30.380 --> 24:32.250
Just take care of yourself.

432
24:32.660 --> 24:34.210
I just hope you can

433
24:34.490 --> 24:35.490
fly higher

434
24:36.860 --> 24:37.770
and further.

435
24:45.940 --> 24:46.660
Mentor,

436
24:47.210 --> 24:48.530
I've bought your ticket

437
24:48.530 --> 24:49.900
to Pangzhou.

438
24:50.820 --> 24:52.220
At this stage of the plan,

439
24:52.320 --> 24:53.320
you can

440
24:54.140 --> 24:55.450
leave the rest to me.

441
24:59.970 --> 25:02.970
The 36 revolutions of the Kan and Li; yet there remains

442
25:03.340 --> 25:06.140
the meeting of the Dragon and Tiger in the dantian.

443
25:07.580 --> 25:09.530
This is the final hurdle.

444
25:09.920 --> 25:11.850
Whether you can cross it

445
25:11.890 --> 25:13.530
is in the hands of destiny.

446
25:13.560 --> 25:14.670
Don't worry.

447
25:15.620 --> 25:17.050
I've dug the graves for

448
25:17.900 --> 25:18.960
the remaining few.

449
25:19.010 --> 25:20.380
As your mentor,

450
25:20.970 --> 25:23.250
I've taught you everything I know.

451
25:26.100 --> 25:27.490
I'm getting old.

452
25:28.180 --> 25:29.580
All I see

453
25:30.140 --> 25:31.730
are old grudges.

454
25:31.970 --> 25:33.660
But you can see very far.

455
25:34.380 --> 25:35.450
Right now,

456
25:35.580 --> 25:38.310
I just want Tianxiang Sect wiped from this world.

457
25:38.620 --> 25:40.250
I don't want anyone else...

458
25:41.710 --> 25:43.770
to get caught up in grudges like mine.

459
25:53.770 --> 25:54.620
Mentor.

460
26:43.660 --> 26:44.690
Please come in.

461
26:45.090 --> 26:46.780
[Chunfeng House]

462
26:53.770 --> 26:54.380
Come in.

463
27:00.350 --> 27:01.620
You sure are bold to

464
27:01.970 --> 27:03.300
run around when they are

465
27:03.490 --> 27:04.380
hunting you down.

466
27:04.380 --> 27:05.710
Now the sect is in chaos,

467
27:05.820 --> 27:07.210
with Qin Baichuan in charge.

468
27:07.210 --> 27:09.210
His ambition is no secret to anyone.

469
27:09.940 --> 27:11.210
So what's your plan?

470
27:12.660 --> 27:14.390
I've got my eye on a scam target.

471
27:14.530 --> 27:15.420
He has the

472
27:15.420 --> 27:17.340
inside information on Qin Baichuan's rebellion.

473
27:17.340 --> 27:18.450
Do me a favor.

474
27:18.770 --> 27:19.490
Go find him

475
27:20.020 --> 27:21.450
and get the evidence.

476
27:22.860 --> 27:24.860
Here are the address and the ticket.

477
27:30.190 --> 27:32.680
[13 Wanping Road, Qiu Mansion, Pujiang]

478
27:33.340 --> 27:34.100
Pujiang.

479
27:35.340 --> 27:36.340
That's quite far.

480
27:38.340 --> 27:39.250
What about you?

481
27:39.490 --> 27:40.970
Staying here all alone,

482
27:41.940 --> 27:43.470
what are you planning to do?

483
27:44.420 --> 27:45.140
I'll be—

484
27:45.140 --> 27:47.000
They're hunting you everywhere.

485
27:47.380 --> 27:48.530
How about this?

486
27:49.210 --> 27:50.210
You go find him.

487
27:50.490 --> 27:51.620
It's a good chance

488
27:52.770 --> 27:53.860
to lay low.

489
27:53.990 --> 27:56.450
To take this throne, you're the first person

490
27:57.030 --> 27:58.900
Qin Baichuan will try to eliminate.

491
27:58.900 --> 28:00.900
You're the chief of Yuehaitang Branch,

492
28:00.900 --> 28:02.900
which makes you his biggest threat.

493
28:03.730 --> 28:05.590
It's not safe for you to stay here.

494
28:11.760 --> 28:13.020
Shangguan Chengming,

495
28:14.670 --> 28:16.930
so you're sending me away because you are

496
28:17.850 --> 28:19.250
worried about my safety.

497
28:19.940 --> 28:21.860
Then you can stay behind alone

498
28:22.580 --> 28:24.180
and fight them all.

499
28:25.210 --> 28:25.970
Right?

500
28:32.370 --> 28:33.450
As you know...

501
28:35.140 --> 28:37.270
until Tianxiang Sect is annihilated,

502
28:38.510 --> 28:39.800
I'm staying right here—

503
28:39.410 --> 28:42.730
♪ May you journey toward your future ♪

504
28:42.750 --> 28:45.640
♪ Leave this stormy sea behind ♪

505
28:46.250 --> 28:49.770
♪ Let the toxic love we shared ♪

506
28:49.800 --> 28:52.640
♪ Be the moss that helps you grow ♪

507
28:53.220 --> 28:56.840
♪ May you find your way out of the haze that is us ♪

508
28:56.870 --> 28:59.690
♪ Leave me out of your story ♪

509
29:00.460 --> 29:03.590
♪ Should freedom be your ultimate desire ♪

510
29:03.610 --> 29:08.010
♪ I shall bloom for you in silence ♪

511
29:11.770 --> 29:13.140
You said it yourself:

512
29:13.970 --> 29:16.170
If you fear death, go home and rear pigs.

513
30:09.660 --> 30:11.010
Since everyone is here,

514
30:11.330 --> 30:14.290
we must allow Sect Master to rest in peace today.

515
30:15.940 --> 30:16.800
Eldest Master,

516
30:17.250 --> 30:18.290
don't you agree?

517
30:18.940 --> 30:20.800
You're very thoughtful, Feiyan.

518
30:20.970 --> 30:21.730
Now,

519
30:22.210 --> 30:24.100
bring Shangguan Chengming in!

520
30:32.290 --> 30:33.090
Jiang Feiyan,

521
30:33.490 --> 30:34.900
you captured him.

522
30:35.990 --> 30:37.710
The credit goes to you.

523
30:37.740 --> 30:39.350
But it's not your place

524
30:39.420 --> 30:41.020
to speak here.

525
30:41.210 --> 30:42.050
Men,

526
30:42.290 --> 30:43.720
drag him out and execute him!

527
30:43.720 --> 30:45.850
Let's see who dares to lay a hand on him!

528
30:46.250 --> 30:47.510
Since when does a woman

529
30:47.900 --> 30:49.900
call the shots in Tianxiang Sect?

530
30:49.930 --> 30:52.620
Tianxiang Sect has abandoned the fight for justice.

531
30:52.620 --> 30:54.680
Does it matter if a woman is in charge?

532
30:55.180 --> 30:56.110
Starting today,

533
30:56.400 --> 30:57.730
whoever is most capable

534
30:57.840 --> 30:59.430
will rule Tianxiang Sect!

535
31:01.530 --> 31:02.690
So you want to be

536
31:03.050 --> 31:04.920
the new sect master?

537
31:05.050 --> 31:06.110
You got that right.

538
31:06.770 --> 31:08.660
I want to be the sect master

539
31:08.860 --> 31:10.320
and establish my own sect.

540
31:24.660 --> 31:25.490
Come clean.

541
31:25.770 --> 31:26.730
Who ordered you

542
31:27.530 --> 31:29.050
to kill Sect Master?

543
31:32.490 --> 31:33.140
Answer me!

544
31:34.100 --> 31:36.300
Since you're throwing me under the bus,

545
31:37.100 --> 31:38.660
I'll spill everything.

546
31:39.970 --> 31:40.570
It was him,

547
31:40.620 --> 31:41.450
Qin Baichuan.

548
31:41.620 --> 31:43.490
He wanted me to pose as Sect Master's son

549
31:43.490 --> 31:44.550
to get close to him,

550
31:44.660 --> 31:46.490
gain his absolute trust, and then strike

551
31:46.490 --> 31:47.950
when the moment was right!

552
31:51.820 --> 31:53.100
Shangguan Chengming,

553
31:53.210 --> 31:55.340
you're quite the strategist, huh?

554
31:56.010 --> 31:58.450
It wasn't me who wanted Sect Master dead

555
31:58.450 --> 32:00.730
but you and Jiang Feiyan!

556
32:02.140 --> 32:03.250
In 1928,

557
32:03.580 --> 32:04.730
Wang Jiaxian

558
32:05.100 --> 32:06.030
and Jiang Feiyan

559
32:06.380 --> 32:07.660
tied the knot.

560
32:08.010 --> 32:08.970
I found this

561
32:09.100 --> 32:11.420
from your hometown, Jianghuai.

562
32:11.530 --> 32:12.450
One of you

563
32:12.660 --> 32:14.520
pretended to be Sect Master's son

564
32:14.660 --> 32:15.660
to poison him,

565
32:15.660 --> 32:17.050
while the other covered it up

566
32:17.050 --> 32:18.580
and joined the scam.

567
32:18.730 --> 32:20.860
You haven't even wiped your own asses,

568
32:20.940 --> 32:23.870
and you're trying to dump your feces on someone else?

569
32:24.050 --> 32:24.900
Everyone,

570
32:25.050 --> 32:26.490
what is the punishment

571
32:26.690 --> 32:27.970
for treachery?

572
32:27.970 --> 32:29.050
Human oil candle!

573
32:29.050 --> 32:30.420
Yes, human oil candle!

574
32:30.770 --> 32:33.860
Arrest Jiang Feiyan and Wang Jiaxian!

575
32:33.860 --> 32:35.280
Treachery does warrant

576
32:36.350 --> 32:37.900
the human oil candle punishment.

577
32:37.900 --> 32:39.660
But it's still uncertain

578
32:40.180 --> 32:41.510
who the real traitor is.

579
32:42.210 --> 32:44.140
I have a piece of evidence here too.

580
32:44.300 --> 32:45.610
Will you read it...

581
32:48.050 --> 32:49.290
or will your son,

582
32:49.940 --> 32:51.210
Qin Huiming, read it?

583
32:55.690 --> 32:56.290
Go,

584
32:56.490 --> 32:58.080
get us brothers another pot of wine.

585
32:58.080 --> 32:59.210
Yes, Eldest Master.

586
33:13.210 --> 33:13.820
How was it?

587
33:15.000 --> 33:16.830
I eavesdropped outside the window for a long time,

588
33:16.830 --> 33:18.420
but I heard nothing unusual.

589
33:18.420 --> 33:20.690
They talked about protecting Sect Master's empire,

590
33:20.690 --> 33:22.070
and Qin Baichuan told Second Master

591
33:22.070 --> 33:22.790
to stay away

592
33:22.820 --> 33:23.770
from Fifth Batou.

593
33:23.770 --> 33:25.370
Qin Baichuan is threatening

594
33:25.530 --> 33:26.730
Second Batou into

595
33:26.730 --> 33:28.010
handing over Jiang Feiyan.

596
33:28.010 --> 33:29.940
So he's the one who wants to revolt.

597
33:30.210 --> 33:31.140
He bided his time

598
33:31.180 --> 33:32.400
and finally got the chance.

599
33:32.400 --> 33:34.290
Qin Baichuan wants to pull Second Batou to his side.

600
33:34.290 --> 33:36.210
Then they're about to make a move.

601
33:36.450 --> 33:38.820
Second Batou might not necessarily join his sinking ship.

602
33:38.820 --> 33:39.650
But I bet

603
33:40.100 --> 33:41.600
Qin Baichuan has a backup plan.

604
33:41.600 --> 33:43.200
During their conversation,

605
33:43.230 --> 33:45.000
a gofer was there the whole time.

606
33:45.000 --> 33:45.940
Why wasn't Qin Baichuan

607
33:45.940 --> 33:48.380
worried about the gofer hearing such secrets?

608
33:48.380 --> 33:51.090
Qin Baichuan probably wanted the gofer to hear it.

609
33:51.090 --> 33:52.220
Where's that gofer?

610
34:02.690 --> 34:03.750
It's been forever,

611
34:03.820 --> 34:05.050
and still, nobody has

612
34:05.050 --> 34:06.310
touched base with him.

613
34:06.530 --> 34:07.450
How about I just

614
34:08.780 --> 34:09.580
grab him here?

615
34:09.610 --> 34:10.340
A few punches

616
34:10.489 --> 34:11.350
and he'll talk.

617
34:12.340 --> 34:13.540
Catching him is easy.

618
34:13.630 --> 34:14.739
If Qin Baichuan

619
34:14.739 --> 34:16.350
secures proof of our rebellion,

620
34:16.350 --> 34:17.659
we're dead either way.

621
34:18.820 --> 34:19.420
Why are

622
34:19.420 --> 34:21.750
the mosquitoes only biting me and not you?

623
34:28.610 --> 34:29.570
I'll follow him.

624
34:29.670 --> 34:30.429
You go to the river

625
34:30.429 --> 34:32.300
and see if he left anything behind.

626
34:32.300 --> 34:33.449
Stay put. I'll go.

627
34:33.780 --> 34:35.420
If his contact shows up,

628
34:35.699 --> 34:37.300
I can handle them.

629
34:37.820 --> 34:38.489
Okay.

630
35:30.170 --> 35:31.130
Brothers,

631
35:31.380 --> 35:32.510
Sect Master is dead.

632
35:33.090 --> 35:34.450
Before the funeral altar,

633
35:34.450 --> 35:35.940
burning incense is the signal.

634
35:35.940 --> 35:37.480
Raise the banner of justice,

635
35:37.480 --> 35:39.010
revolt, and seize the sect.

636
35:39.220 --> 35:40.530
From Qin Huiming.

637
35:41.220 --> 35:42.080
Eldest Master,

638
35:42.120 --> 35:44.760
you're truly blessed in this life.

639
35:44.800 --> 35:46.160
You actually have a son.

640
35:46.450 --> 35:48.110
Why didn't you tell everyone?

641
35:51.240 --> 35:53.880
Do you think you can sling mud

642
35:54.340 --> 35:55.780
with a fake letter?

643
35:55.800 --> 35:57.660
How is it that your photos are real

644
35:58.010 --> 35:59.490
but my evidence is fake?

645
35:59.600 --> 36:00.470
Besides,

646
36:00.820 --> 36:02.170
he is right here.

647
36:03.700 --> 36:04.830
We'll know the truth

648
36:05.100 --> 36:06.480
once we test it.

649
36:08.860 --> 36:09.570
Enough!

650
36:10.260 --> 36:11.470
Shangguan Chengming,

651
36:11.470 --> 36:12.740
you deceived Sixth Batou,

652
36:12.740 --> 36:13.700
killed Sect Master,

653
36:13.700 --> 36:15.260
and dragged Feiyan into danger with you.

654
36:15.260 --> 36:16.420
Isn't that enough?

655
36:16.530 --> 36:17.740
Now you're here falsely

656
36:17.740 --> 36:18.970
accusing Chief Batou!

657
36:18.970 --> 36:19.830
Second Master,

658
36:19.860 --> 36:21.630
you've followed Sect Master for so long.

659
36:21.630 --> 36:23.710
You wouldn't want him to roll over

660
36:24.260 --> 36:25.590
in his grave, would you?

661
36:27.570 --> 36:28.450
Eldest Master,

662
36:28.700 --> 36:29.780
it's simple.

663
36:31.050 --> 36:32.580
Trade this gofer's life...

664
36:34.420 --> 36:35.820
to prove your innocence.

665
36:41.850 --> 36:42.710
Eldest Master.

666
36:47.300 --> 36:47.650
Okay,

667
36:48.340 --> 36:49.140
I'll help you.

668
36:52.610 --> 36:53.940
He is my son!

669
36:54.340 --> 36:55.090
I'm...

670
36:55.230 --> 36:57.110
I'm revolting today!

671
37:00.090 --> 37:01.750
I've already deployed my men.

672
37:02.170 --> 37:03.940
Zhou is already dead!

673
37:04.130 --> 37:05.660
The position of Sect Master

674
37:06.130 --> 37:08.270
belongs to me, Qin Baichuan!

675
37:08.300 --> 37:09.160
Eldest Master!

676
37:10.020 --> 37:11.830
Freeze! Drop your knives!

677
37:11.860 --> 37:15.010
Freeze! Drop your knives!

678
37:16.340 --> 37:17.900
Where did you come from?

679
37:23.960 --> 37:25.850
The men you placed in ambush

680
37:26.780 --> 37:27.980
outside the city were

681
37:28.170 --> 37:29.340
all wiped out by me.

682
37:29.420 --> 37:29.970
You...

683
37:31.220 --> 37:32.300
Interesting.

684
37:50.500 --> 37:51.540
How interesting.

685
37:52.230 --> 37:54.430
I've attended many funerals in my life,

686
37:55.340 --> 37:57.450
but attending my own

687
37:57.640 --> 37:59.110
is a first.

688
38:02.380 --> 38:04.700
Quick, go brew some alum soup

689
38:05.120 --> 38:05.970
to detoxify me.

690
38:05.970 --> 38:07.090
Careful, Master.

691
38:07.610 --> 38:08.700
I'll go right away.

692
38:40.680 --> 38:41.590
You're here.

693
38:42.160 --> 38:43.030
Yes, I'm here.

694
38:47.650 --> 38:50.360
What are all those people waiting for outside?

695
38:51.270 --> 38:52.540
Waiting for me to die.

696
39:01.700 --> 39:02.490
Come on.

697
39:03.490 --> 39:05.490
You've worked hard all these years.

698
39:06.560 --> 39:08.370
Let me pour you a cup of tea.

699
39:11.250 --> 39:12.310
Thank you, Master.

700
39:12.410 --> 39:13.220
Drink up.

701
39:21.300 --> 39:22.760
Is your family doing well?

702
39:22.780 --> 39:23.450
Yes,

703
39:23.650 --> 39:24.490
they're good.

704
39:25.610 --> 39:27.570
I know you have 3 kids.

705
39:27.620 --> 39:28.650
Are your finances okay?

706
39:28.650 --> 39:29.380
Yes,

707
39:29.400 --> 39:31.060
you've always been generous.

708
39:33.220 --> 39:34.860
When things ease up,

709
39:35.860 --> 39:36.860
take a trip home.

710
39:36.940 --> 39:39.820
Spend some quality time with your wife and kids.

711
39:40.020 --> 39:42.170
It's been a while since you went back, right?

712
39:42.170 --> 39:43.230
Thank you, Master.

713
39:45.160 --> 39:46.360
Over the years...

714
40:06.550 --> 40:07.760
Don't worry.

715
40:08.090 --> 40:10.070
I'll take good care of your family for you.

716
40:10.070 --> 40:11.520
No one can leave the premises

717
40:11.520 --> 40:13.290
until Sect Master comes out.

718
40:15.910 --> 40:16.790
Senior?

719
40:17.610 --> 40:18.420
Senior?

720
40:18.900 --> 40:19.650
Senior!

721
40:20.300 --> 40:21.630
Somebody come quickly!

722
40:22.170 --> 40:22.700
Senior?

723
40:22.860 --> 40:23.420
Senior!

724
40:23.700 --> 40:24.610
What happened to Sect Master?

725
40:24.610 --> 40:24.940
Sect Master!

726
40:24.940 --> 40:25.420
Master!

727
40:25.940 --> 40:27.170
Master!

728
40:27.700 --> 40:28.450
Senior,

729
40:28.900 --> 40:30.700
trust that I'll avenge you.

730
40:31.170 --> 40:32.220
I promise.

731
40:37.530 --> 40:38.010
S-Sect...

732
40:38.010 --> 40:38.740
Sect Master?

733
40:40.340 --> 40:41.220
Qin,

734
40:42.780 --> 40:44.450
if you want my throne,

735
40:44.680 --> 40:46.030
just say it.

736
40:46.300 --> 40:47.560
Why go to such lengths?

737
40:49.250 --> 40:51.330
You knew he was Wang Jiaxian,

738
40:51.530 --> 40:52.300
but you kept mum,

739
40:52.300 --> 40:54.260
so as to use him to do your dirty work.

740
40:54.260 --> 40:55.300
Director Wang,

741
40:55.910 --> 40:58.200
what punishment does this call for?

742
40:58.410 --> 41:00.820
The father and son, Qin Baichuan and Qin Huiming,

743
41:00.820 --> 41:03.430
defrauded the people and committed murder for money.

744
41:03.430 --> 41:04.840
They deserve to die.

745
41:05.650 --> 41:06.510
Death penalty.

746
41:06.780 --> 41:07.700
Execute them on the spot.

747
41:07.700 --> 41:08.060
Take them away!

748
41:08.060 --> 41:08.830
Wait.

749
41:09.520 --> 41:11.480
Let me say one thing before you go.

750
41:14.610 --> 41:15.700
As things stand,

751
41:15.760 --> 41:18.390
this is where we part ways, my brother.

752
41:19.050 --> 41:21.110
There's nothing else I can do for you.

753
41:21.720 --> 41:22.520
Tell you what,

754
41:23.070 --> 41:25.550
I'll pay for the bullets to execute you.

755
41:27.460 --> 41:28.340
Director Wang,

756
41:28.780 --> 41:30.040
buy a few more bullets.

757
41:30.340 --> 41:31.340
That's a lot.

758
41:32.970 --> 41:33.640
Take him away.

759
41:33.640 --> 41:34.840
You old fox!

760
41:35.090 --> 41:36.470
You'll meet a dreadful end!

761
41:36.470 --> 41:38.200
I'll haunt you from the grave!

762
41:38.380 --> 41:39.450
You old fox!

763
41:39.610 --> 41:41.380
You'll die a horrible death!

764
41:41.700 --> 41:42.560
Director Wang,

765
41:42.570 --> 41:43.700
since you're here,

766
41:43.700 --> 41:45.360
have a cup of tea before you go.

767
41:45.360 --> 41:47.160
I have official business to handle,

768
41:47.160 --> 41:48.280
so I won't stay.

769
41:48.530 --> 41:50.370
Let's catch up another day.

770
41:50.400 --> 41:51.350
Another day.

771
41:55.490 --> 41:56.380
Just one shot?

772
41:57.490 --> 41:58.420
Give it a second.

773
42:00.420 --> 42:01.170
Satisfying.

774
42:01.340 --> 42:01.970
All done.

775
42:02.450 --> 42:03.130
Thank you.

776
42:03.580 --> 42:04.640
I'll take my leave.

777
42:15.530 --> 42:17.610
Wang Jiaxian,

778
42:17.970 --> 42:19.010
right?

779
42:19.420 --> 42:20.300
I set the scene

780
42:20.300 --> 42:21.650
perfectly for you.

781
42:22.650 --> 42:24.780
How did you mess it up like this?

782
42:26.170 --> 42:27.370
I'll get to the point.

783
42:27.610 --> 42:29.090
Tomorrow at Yunhe Temple,

784
42:29.170 --> 42:31.450
Wang Jiaxian and Jiang Feiyan will be subjected to

785
42:31.450 --> 42:32.900
the human oil candle punishment.

786
42:32.900 --> 42:34.050
Do it the old way,

787
42:34.300 --> 42:36.010
full scale and by the book.

788
42:43.160 --> 42:45.010
You guys, keep a close eye on them.

789
42:45.010 --> 42:45.860
Yes!

790
42:47.490 --> 42:49.940
Shangguan Chengming and Jiang Feiyan

791
42:50.130 --> 42:51.740
both played themselves.

792
42:52.090 --> 42:53.420
What a ruthless move

793
42:53.860 --> 42:54.940
from Sect Master.

794
42:55.220 --> 42:56.820
By feigning dead,

795
42:57.010 --> 42:59.410
he not only rooted out these two traitors,

796
42:59.650 --> 43:01.740
but even got rid of Qin Baichuan,

797
43:01.740 --> 43:03.270
the long-standing threat.

798
43:04.010 --> 43:04.740
Brilliant.

799
43:06.010 --> 43:07.340
Absolutely brilliant.

800
43:07.940 --> 43:08.970
Third Brother,

801
43:09.940 --> 43:11.450
now only Second Brother

802
43:11.610 --> 43:12.820
is above you.

803
43:13.530 --> 43:14.490
And Sect Master

804
43:14.650 --> 43:15.860
told us to handle

805
43:15.860 --> 43:18.090
the human oil candle punishment well.

806
43:18.170 --> 43:19.030
Why do you think

807
43:19.700 --> 43:20.700
that is?

808
43:25.700 --> 43:27.220
Sect Master has run out of

809
43:27.450 --> 43:29.180
competent people he can trust.

810
43:29.530 --> 43:31.700
Our chance has come.

811
43:44.700 --> 43:45.700
Have some tea.

812
43:50.820 --> 43:51.380
Master,

813
43:51.530 --> 43:53.260
you raised Feiyan yourself.

814
43:53.650 --> 43:55.850
She's basically half a daughter to you.

815
43:56.170 --> 43:57.650
Please spare her life.

816
43:57.860 --> 43:58.940
The tea is cold.

817
43:59.420 --> 44:00.880
Go get some boiling water.

818
44:04.050 --> 44:04.700
Master,

819
44:05.010 --> 44:06.010
Feiyan has worked

820
44:06.130 --> 44:08.300
tirelessly for the sect all these years.

821
44:08.300 --> 44:10.340
Her efforts alone deserve credit.

822
44:10.570 --> 44:12.830
Think of how much money she's made for us.

823
44:12.940 --> 44:14.130
It's not worth

824
44:14.380 --> 44:15.780
losing one of our Batous

825
44:17.300 --> 44:18.700
over that punk, Master!

826
44:25.220 --> 44:27.450
I know you have a soft spot for her

827
44:28.530 --> 44:30.130
and can't bear to see her die.

828
44:30.220 --> 44:31.860
I don't have the heart to either.

829
44:31.860 --> 44:33.450
I want to spare her too,

830
44:33.900 --> 44:36.380
but the rules are the rules.

831
44:43.420 --> 44:44.220
I understand.

832
44:46.470 --> 44:47.800
A life for a life.

833
44:49.490 --> 44:50.900
What's with this act now?

834
44:51.000 --> 44:52.740
I think you've watched too many plays, trying to be

835
44:52.740 --> 44:53.790
the knight in shining armor.

836
44:53.790 --> 44:54.780
Listen up.

837
44:55.380 --> 44:56.420
Those stories are

838
44:56.450 --> 44:59.010
made up by actors to sell tickets.

839
44:59.220 --> 45:00.620
Those are performances!

840
45:00.900 --> 45:02.530
Life only begins after

841
45:02.860 --> 45:04.260
you step off the stage.

842
45:04.420 --> 45:06.100
Feiyan's time is up.

843
45:06.130 --> 45:07.450
She must die.

844
45:07.450 --> 45:08.780
It's not a decision I made.

845
45:08.780 --> 45:10.860
It's arranged by heaven.

846
45:12.170 --> 45:13.420
You want to help her?

847
45:14.420 --> 45:15.380
Fine.

848
45:21.050 --> 45:22.580
Make your strike accurate.

849
45:22.940 --> 45:24.450
Give her a quick end

850
45:24.940 --> 45:26.780
so she suffers less.

851
45:28.940 --> 45:32.610
Just like how I killed Shangguan Hong with my own hands back then.

852
45:36.380 --> 45:37.170
Huaiyi,

853
45:38.380 --> 45:41.380
transcend romantic attachments,

854
45:42.970 --> 45:44.530
and you'll be king.

855
46:01.420 --> 46:02.150
Understood.

856
46:17.940 --> 46:36.120
♪ There is a fiery woman in the brothel ♪

857
46:32.220 --> 46:33.050
Feiyan,

858
46:33.650 --> 46:34.940
back then,

859
46:36.170 --> 46:38.220
you used to warm up your voice

860
46:39.380 --> 46:40.420
and practice

861
46:41.650 --> 46:42.710
in this courtyard.

862
46:46.740 --> 46:48.820
I was so hopeless back then.

863
46:50.390 --> 46:51.550
I always liked to

864
46:52.260 --> 46:53.740
secretly watch you

865
46:54.170 --> 46:55.220
from afar.

866
46:56.260 --> 46:57.090
Just watching

867
46:58.260 --> 46:59.220
and watching...

868
47:02.780 --> 47:04.220
Until the day I saw you

869
47:05.050 --> 47:06.220
put on the makeup,

870
47:06.780 --> 47:07.910
step onto the stage,

871
47:08.130 --> 47:10.330
and win the applause of the whole house.

872
47:11.970 --> 47:14.490
I can no longer protect you anymore.

873
47:14.840 --> 47:15.570
Remember,

874
47:16.220 --> 47:18.890
you must fly higher...

875
47:20.170 --> 47:21.090
and go

876
47:21.490 --> 47:22.450
further.

877
48:28.740 --> 48:30.140
I'll just say a few words.

878
48:37.810 --> 48:38.740
Fourth Brother.

879
48:40.700 --> 48:41.820
Chengming,

880
48:43.860 --> 48:45.520
it was a pleasure knowing you.

881
48:45.530 --> 48:47.260
You'll be on your way tomorrow.

882
48:47.260 --> 48:48.380
Let's have a drink

883
48:48.380 --> 48:49.900
as my farewell to you.

884
48:50.300 --> 48:51.230
Fourth Brother,

885
48:51.820 --> 48:53.750
you're putting yourself in danger

886
48:54.050 --> 48:55.090
by visiting me.

887
48:55.450 --> 48:56.420
Don't worry.

888
48:56.700 --> 48:58.910
In Tianxiang Sect, I alone master Western knowledge.

889
48:58.910 --> 49:00.910
Sect Master can't afford to kill me.

890
49:03.340 --> 49:04.790
I just hate myself for

891
49:05.570 --> 49:07.050
not being able to save you.

892
49:09.220 --> 49:10.150
Fourth Brother,

893
49:18.700 --> 49:20.570
please do me one last favor.

894
49:30.300 --> 49:31.160
Fourth Master,

895
49:31.300 --> 49:32.340
Sect Master ordered

896
49:32.340 --> 49:34.380
that no one who's seen Shangguan Chengming

897
49:34.380 --> 49:35.530
is allowed to leave.

898
49:40.190 --> 49:43.190
With the war intensifying outside,

899
49:43.330 --> 49:45.210
word has come down from the top

900
49:46.090 --> 49:49.040
that Yucheng is now our official rear base.

901
49:49.320 --> 49:50.880
With this decree,

902
49:50.940 --> 49:52.340
the military and police systems

903
49:52.340 --> 49:54.490
in Yucheng have undergone multiple purges.

904
49:54.490 --> 49:56.000
It's recent: the deputy director

905
49:56.000 --> 49:57.340
from headquarters,

906
49:57.340 --> 49:59.300
his name and identity are all kept secret.

907
49:59.300 --> 50:00.430
No one knows a thing.

908
50:01.050 --> 50:02.380
My words don't carry

909
50:02.700 --> 50:04.360
as much weight as they used to.

910
50:04.900 --> 50:06.130
It's hard enough

911
50:06.820 --> 50:09.420
to protect myself, let alone help a friend out.

912
50:10.820 --> 50:12.530
Times are tough

913
50:12.530 --> 50:14.130
for everyone right now.

914
50:14.130 --> 50:15.740
But times like these are exactly when

915
50:15.740 --> 50:18.170
we buddies should help each other out.

916
50:18.200 --> 50:19.000
Tell you what,

917
50:19.070 --> 50:20.670
I'll give you an extra 10% cut

918
50:21.470 --> 50:23.220
from Tianxiang Sect's business—

919
50:23.220 --> 50:25.350
make life a little easier for you, bud.

920
50:25.570 --> 50:26.380
Truth be told,

921
50:26.380 --> 50:29.050
you're talking about Tianxiang Sect's internal affairs,

922
50:29.050 --> 50:32.180
something a guy in uniform like me can't get involved in.

923
50:33.200 --> 50:34.800
Then I'll add another 10%.

924
50:36.860 --> 50:37.990
How does that sound?

925
50:38.010 --> 50:40.650
You're truly a master of calculation.

926
50:40.680 --> 50:42.470
It's all thanks to you that

927
50:42.760 --> 50:45.430
I get to stick around in Yucheng.

928
50:48.670 --> 50:52.560
[Sever the Heavenly Light]

929
50:59.610 --> 51:00.810
Heaven hides no evil,

930
51:01.260 --> 51:02.790
and earth harbors no filth.

931
51:02.820 --> 51:04.780
Wang Jiaxian and Jiang Feiyan have

932
51:04.870 --> 51:06.270
violated the sect rules

933
51:06.600 --> 51:07.750
and shall be subjected

934
51:07.750 --> 51:09.750
to the human oil candle punishment.

935
51:09.780 --> 51:11.130
Cleansing Matron.

936
51:12.520 --> 51:13.440
Proceed.

937
51:13.840 --> 51:14.680
Yes.

938
51:19.260 --> 51:20.940
Today, we have rebellious disciples

939
51:20.940 --> 51:22.450
who disrupted our sect's order.

940
51:22.450 --> 51:24.450
Kill them! Kill them!

941
51:24.700 --> 51:26.820
First, we invite the past sect masters

942
51:26.820 --> 51:29.820
to witness your crime of betraying the sect!

943
51:29.890 --> 51:31.890
Kill them! Kill them!

944
51:34.970 --> 51:37.090
Second, we invite our fellow disciples

945
51:37.090 --> 51:39.740
to jointly execute you for your treachery.

946
51:39.820 --> 51:41.450
Kill them! Kill them!

947
51:45.260 --> 51:47.420
Third, I summon the disciplinary artifacts

948
51:47.420 --> 51:49.450
to chastise you renegades!

949
51:49.450 --> 51:51.170
Kill them! Kill them!

950
52:00.390 --> 52:01.590
The time has come.

951
52:02.510 --> 52:03.430
Execute them.

952
52:41.010 --> 52:43.280
[In the next episode]

953
52:43.490 --> 52:45.530
Haven't you been dying to kill me?

954
52:46.490 --> 52:47.130
Come on.

955
52:48.010 --> 52:49.210
I'll grant your wish.

956
52:50.050 --> 52:51.170
What a rare guest.

957
52:51.810 --> 52:52.680
Do you need something?

958
52:52.680 --> 52:53.380
Yes.

959
52:53.380 --> 52:54.300
What is it?

960
52:56.010 --> 52:56.780
A life exchange.

961
52:56.780 --> 52:57.820
Are you done living?

962
52:57.820 --> 52:58.650
Long ago.

963
52:58.650 --> 52:59.700
Deal.

964
53:01.340 --> 53:02.540
How do you want to die?

965
53:03.170 --> 53:04.220
I get to choose?

966
53:05.220 --> 53:06.170
Sure.

967
53:06.170 --> 53:08.220
You're so ruthless.

968
53:08.740 --> 53:10.090
Not as evil as you.

969
53:12.650 --> 53:14.130
Let me tell you something.

970
53:15.540 --> 53:18.210
You've met the real Shangguan Chengming.
